{"code":200,"message":"OK","tweet":{"url":"https://x.com/firesidealpha/status/2108930562794864912","id":"2108930562794864912","text":"Qualcomm CEO reveals AI companies want phones running 100-billion-parameter models continuously by 2028--and confirms some are building phones\n\nCristiano Amon: “I have to be careful not to disclose names, but some AI companies—some of the companies at the forefront of AI—are telling Qualcomm, ‘By 2028, I need to make sure that I have the ability to run at least a 100-billion-parameter model in a phone, and I need to have this thing running kind of all the time.’”\n\nAlex Heath: “So you’re saying there are AI companies that are talking about—”\n\nCristiano Amon: “Well, AI companies are starting to do phones.”","raw_text":{"text":"Qualcomm CEO reveals AI companies want phones running 100-billion-parameter models continuously by 2028--and confirms some are building phones\n\nCristiano Amon: “I have to be careful not to disclose names, but some AI companies—some of the companies at the forefront of AI—are telling Qualcomm, ‘By 2028, I need to make sure that I have the ability to run at least a 100-billion-parameter model in a phone, and I need to have this thing running kind of all the time.’”\n\nAlex Heath: “So you’re saying there are AI companies that are talking about—”\n\nCristiano Amon: “Well, AI companies are starting to do phones.”","display_text_range":[0,611],"facets":[{"type":"media","indices":[276,299],"id":"2108930121558380544","display":"pic.x.com/3Gded1a9Ld","original":"https://t.co/3Gded1a9Ld","replacement":"https://x.com/firesidealpha/status/2108930562794864912/video/1"}]},"author":{"screen_name":"firesidealpha","url":"https://x.com/firesidealpha","id":"2066250685512110080","followers":28834,"following":340,"likes":2951,"media_count":1456,"name":"Fireside Alpha","description":"Learn what the best in business and tech are seeing, then go find your edge\n@firesidetapes for business legends\nDM for business inquiries","raw_